# [PHASE 1]: CORE ASSET INTEGRITY
# Prevent the SPA from intercepting actual binary files.
/assets/* /assets/:splat    200
/favicon.ico /favicon.ico      200
/manifest.json /manifest.json  200

# [PHASE 2]: API PROXY GATES (Optional/Future Proofing)
# If we ever need to hide API keys or bypass CORS for Faceit/Akros
# /api/* https://api.pixelpalace.gg/:splat  200

# [PHASE 3]: SPA NEURAL LINK
# Redirect all path requests to the index.html entry point.
# This allows React Router to resolve nested paths like /match/:id
/* /index.html    200

# [PHASE 4]: ERROR CONTAINMENT
# If index.html fails to load, force redirect to landing.
# Error 404 /index.html 200
